The files in this directory are synthetic demonstration inputs for the
atrium-digital-convert skill. They were generated by
tests/fixtures/digital/make_fixtures.py on the repository's test branch, and
contain a fictitious excavation report and placeholder text, no archival data:

  enrichable.pdf  one page of Czech archaeological prose (without diacritics)
  image_only.pdf  a text page, an image-only page and an empty page
  minimal.docx    a heading, two paragraphs, a 2x2 table and a page break

